---
const faqs = [
  {
    question: "What does Tankrich AI Consulting do?",
    answer: "We are a specialist AI consultancy. We provide AI strategy and advisory, accelerated AI product development, RAG and knowledge systems, intelligent agents and automation, conversational AI, and data and decision intelligence, taking organisations from AI ambition all the way to production systems."
  },
  {
    question: "How quickly can you deliver an AI solution?",
    answer: "Most engagements move from concept to a deployed, production-ready solution within a few weeks. We work in fast, visible iterations, you see working software early and often, rather than waiting on a long, opaque project."
  },
  {
    question: "Do you work with clients outside Australia?",
    answer: "Yes. Tankrich AI Consulting is based in Melbourne, Australia and serves clients worldwide. We have delivered work across Australia, India and global markets, and run engagements over WhatsApp, email and video, wherever you are."
  },
  {
    question: "Is our data secure with your AI systems?",
    answer: "Yes. We build on open frameworks and design for data ownership. Your data stays yours, is never resold, and is never used to train external models. Our RAG and knowledge systems keep AI answers grounded in your verified, authoritative sources."
  },
  {
    question: "What is RAG and why does it matter for our business?",
    answer: "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) grounds AI answers in your verified business data, eliminating hallucinations and keeping responses accurate, current and context-aware. It's the difference between a generic chatbot and an AI system that genuinely knows your organisation."
  },
  {
    question: "What technologies and models do you work with?",
    answer: "We work with leading large language models including Claude and GPT, custom RAG pipelines, and modern web and mobile stacks, Next.js, Astro, React, Supabase, Python, deployed on Vercel and Cloudflare. We choose the best tool for each engagement rather than forcing a single stack."
  }
];
---

<section id="faq" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Common questions about working with Tankrich AI Consulting.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">
      {faqs.map(faq => (
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-summary">
            <span>{faq.question}</span>
            <svg class="faq-chevron" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>{faq.answer}</p></div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section { padding: 112px 0; }
  .section-head { max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .section-title { font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 50px); font-weight: 700; margin: 16px 0 20px; }
  .section-lead { font-size: 19px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }

  .faq-list { max-width: 800px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }

  .faq-item { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease; }
  .faq-item:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); }
  .faq-item[open] { border-color: var(--border-strong); }

  .faq-summary {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px 24px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink);
    list-style: none;
  }
  .faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq-chevron { color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }

  .faq-answer { padding: 0 24px 22px; }
  .faq-answer p { font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
</style>
